; bal -V --unrealized --dc books no unrealized gain on a holding whose
; most recent price is in another commodity at the report date than on
; its transaction's date.  -V converts a commodity into the commodity of
; its most recent price, so the euros bought on 2024/01/10 are valued in
; dollars on that date and in pounds from 2024/01/15.  The report cannot
; bring the dollar value to pounds, so each posting of the purchase
; contributes itself to the baseline and adds nothing to the unrealized
; rows, and the report prints what it printed before the balance report
; valued postings at cost.  Booking each column at its value on the
; transaction's date printed an Equity:Unrealized Gains row of "$110.00 /
; 85.00 GBP" in both columns and column totals of "$110.00 / 50.00 GBP",
; although the net column still totalled zero.  The shape is that of
; regress/coverage-history-prices.

P 2024/01/01 EUR 1.10 $
P 2024/01/15 EUR 0.85 GBP

2024/01/10 Buy euros
    Assets:Euros            100 EUR
    Assets:Cash

2024/01/20 Buy pounds
    Assets:Pounds           50 GBP
    Assets:Cash

test bal -V --unrealized --now 2024/04/01
                   0  Assets
         -135.00 GBP    Cash
           85.00 GBP    Euros
           50.00 GBP    Pounds
--------------------
                   0
end test

test bal -V --unrealized --dc --now 2024/04/01
    135.00 GBP     135.00 GBP              0  Assets
             0     135.00 GBP    -135.00 GBP    Cash
     85.00 GBP              0      85.00 GBP    Euros
     50.00 GBP              0      50.00 GBP    Pounds
-------------- -------------- --------------
    135.00 GBP     135.00 GBP              0
end test
